{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"We studied subthalamic correlates of turning motions in 13 PwPD (six female, age at onset: 53.1 ± 10.5 years; disease duration 12.6 ± 5.3 years)\",\n    \"Here, we report findings from turning motions with and without FoG in PwPD, in whom we previously reported neuronal abnormalities related to FoG occurring during regular walking.40\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"Here, we report findings from turning motions with and without FoG in PwPD, in whom we previously reported neuronal abnormalities related to FoG occurring during regular walking.40\",\n    \"40. Klocke, P. et al. Supraspinal contributions to defective antagonistic inhibition and freezing of gait in Parkinson's disease. Brain 147, 4056-4071, doi:10.1093/brain/awae223 (2024).\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"全文明确支持该转弯研究纳入13名患者，而且明确披露这些患者此前已经用于报告与常规行走期间FoG相关的神经异常研究（参考文献40，Klocke等，2024）。因此，全文确实存在同一队列被用于不同研究分析的证据，不能忽略队列重叠问题。不过，必须区分两件事：全文明确披露的是本次13人转弯研究与此前常规行走研究之间的队列重叠，而不是明确说明该转弯研究的预印本与正式发表版本之间的关系。全文没有提及报告Y，没有说明报告Y是否分别纳入了预印本和正式论文，也没有提及评委或审稿人提出过相关意见。因此，报告的说法和指控者对评委意见的描述，都只能获得部分支持。全文支持一般性的队列重叠风险及谨慎区分独立证据的必要性，但不足以证实预印本与正式论文被重复纳入报告Y这一具体事实，也不足以证实评委确实作出了所述判断。不能仅凭这篇全文认定报告Y读错了论文。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1621863a-7d7c-4e63-b08d-d0328c79049a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T104959950693Z", "elapsed_seconds": 76.828, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T10:51:16.778843+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "65453377fce1ac1590fa836a14591babedb0e3393523217a3a4eb3a35e62bcbd", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T104959950693Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "97cecf65e1cce9daf76b6148fc5176e038cf05b8a0aa13d0b69f3190822a3b9c"}}}
